# health.malice.biz is a status bit, not an application. The WAN Worker probes
# it from the internet and reads {"ok": ...} to decide whether to fail the
# Healthchecks check. The backend is a read-only, health-only container bound
# to the WireGuard address; no admin UI and no secrets are exposed here.
health.malice.biz {
	import public_headers
	import log_redacted
	reverse_proxy 10.44.0.2:8098
}
